Hi Alessandro,

I don't know much about *Amelia*, but if you choose to use *mice *for MI,
it's straightforward to match within each dataset. This vignette
<https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/cobalt/vignettes/cobalt_A2_cluster_imp.html>
for *cobalt *includes an example of matching within imputed datasets
using *mice
*and *MatchIt*.

Noah

